      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `956309b4363d98d0ed269274b73a95e17a8fb45382a3416052b5e5ff4b4fcbb2--criminal-courts-2023-24-cube-8-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2023\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 6c7c8b142e6b2a2d0e4938fb392a03f28c5a3d3d229fc33d055916f6b86a43a3 | missing |\n| \"Table 40\" | f311bc729bfeac1f4feebeac32919d82a660ed6df35946f8f4fec2ff897410b2 | missing |\n| \"Table 41\" | a6c3e7f7243481c506159a1c858fddccdcb4557aa6144ad4bd45406eb0aebcdf | missing |\n| \"Table 42\" | 805be78ed3c94b83fbe7de5a2909fbc7fb40c17f24b470e891a3101ab9cde981 | missing |\n| \"Table 43\" | 54106195defffc22a2f24b0302d489352ec46f486dd3703e034449a50ba5f6a0 | missing |\n| \"Table 44\" | b4dd13076ae92896b42ac30f5f91fa45cef0a435ff93e17709a29849d860a9cd | missing |\n| \"Table 45\" | e6ba2232931ff43ae347b213969056816c17099a1a94dfe092c064727acb8324 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (1bab52acae448e776de2924a66613335ceac1df7b6fb401b6ac9ddad44b96aef). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
